-**Strengths and Limitations:**
-The standard Fresnel equations provide physically accurate results for dielectrics [S1, unofficial]. The base method handles unpolarized light at dielectric interfaces, while extensions add thin-film interference and complex-indexed Fresnel for metals [S2, unofficial].
